              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jacqueline J Buell"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My husband and I couldn't believe how this recipe turned out!! I would never have thought to use gingerale in a recipe other than a punch. We enjoyed it so much. Definately a keeper!!! I added sweet baby carrots and some potatoes as well as some garlic, bayleaves oregano and basil just to make it a complete meal and to spice it up a little.\r\nThanks so much for submitting this recipe for everyone to try.",
            "datePublished": "2002-12-24T02:46:32.123Z"
          },
          {
