              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "DIANE CARTWRIGHT"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was very good. I thickened up the sauce to make a nice gravy. Prepared some bowtie pasta &amp; placed the stew and gravy over it. Delicious.",
